# Slice 276: node is an ordinary Structure, two root heads of hits: the explicit path needs an index.  The second head
# was written `hits: 2` before the forms stopped assigning (plan M7, step 4); it is the declaration's repeat now.
int: hits 1
int: hits 2
fn: read () int
    return: node\hits
end: read
send: exit(exit_code: read(); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
